    21	// it, but the session page rendered nothing.
    22	//
    23	// Projection:
    24	//
    25	//	response_item message/user      -> user line, content [{"text": …}]
    26	//	  (input_text, minus the injected <environment_context> harness block)
    27	//	response_item message/assistant -> assistant line, content
    28	//	  [{"type":"text","text":…}]
    29	//	function_call                   -> assistant line with a tool_use block;
    30	//	  the matching function_call_output is nested as the block's result,
    31	//	  with a non-zero exec exit code reported as status "error"
